title: "Anthropic PBC"   # working title — set your own
type: report
abstract: >-
  A public, versioned, cryptographically verifiable counterpoint to Anthropic's
  2026 Public Benefit Report, read against its S-1 and judged by Anthropic's own
  (CC0) Constitution. Every load-bearing quote is checked byte-exact against the
  primary filings with the Descartes verifier; endorsements and disputes are
  collected as cryptographic attestations. A working paper for public contest.
